(text "SPI mode 0, 1MHz, 24 clocks: last 18 bits = channel[1:0], code[15:0]. Five separate CS nets; shared LDAC. SDO pins intentionally unused.\nFirmware sequence: mute -> disable sign switches -> latch signs -> load 20 DAC words -> LDAC -> settle -> restore prior armed state.\nNo automatic rail supervisor is fitted; static operation does not require continuous MCU traffic." (at 20.32 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "203200ca-80e8-50fd-8196-6897193d2c3b"))
